OL,3,AAndy Taylor: Duran Duran's livewire    
OL,4,Aguitarist who was a true Wild Boy      
OL,6,FAndy Taylor, who has died aged 65, was 
OL,7,Fthe wild boy of Duran Duran.           
OL,9,FIn the early 1980s, the pop legends    
OL,10,Fsold over 100 million records and      
OL,11,Fdominated the charts in both Britain   
OL,12,Fand the United States.                 
OL,14,FBut success came at a cost. For Taylor,
OL,15,Fglobal superstardom became a cocaine   
OL,16,Fand alcohol fuelled nightmare that left
OL,17,Fhim burnt out and battling clinical    
OL,18,Fdepression.                            
